📋 Requirements

To run this project successfully, ensure that the following software and tools are installed on your computer.

Requirement| Version| Purpose
Python| 3.10 or above| Programming language
MySQL| 8.0 or above| Database Management System
XAMPP| Latest Version| Local MySQL Server
Visual Studio Code| Latest Version| Code Editor
mysql-connector-python| Latest Version| Python package for MySQL connectivity

Install Required Python Package

Run the following command in the terminal:

pip install -r requirements.txt

Or install the package directly:

pip install mysql-connector-python
